IP address, which Google does not store), device and browser type, and a few actions such as opening the booking calendar or clicking our e-mail address. We have switched off Google signals and ad personalisation, so this data is not linked to your Google account and is not used for advertising. We strip your name and e-mail from our page addresses before anything is sent."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The booking calendar"}]," on our contacts page, which is Cal.com running inside a frame and sets its own cookies."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Neither loads until you say yes. On your first visit a small bar offers"," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Reject all"}],", ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Accept all"}],", or a choice per purpose. Until you answer, and if you reject, the Google Analytics script is never requested and no analytics cookie is set; the calendar is simply never fetched, and you can still e-mail us, press the load button on the calendar itself, or open the same booking page on cal.com directly."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We run no advertising or retargeting of any kind: no Meta or LinkedIn pixels, no Google Ads tags, no selling or sharing of visitor data."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. What is actually stored"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"LegalPage-module__QUED1W__tableWrap","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Name"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Set by"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Purpose"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Type"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Expires"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"awake.consent.v2"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Awake"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Remembers what you allowed (analytics, calendar) and when. Stored in your browser local storage, never sent to us."}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Strictly necessary"}],