f:["$","p",null,{"children":"Strictly necessary storage is used on the basis of our legitimate interest in providing a working, secure website (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR). Anything else is used only with your consent (Article 6(1)(a) GDPR, and the Polish Electronic Communications Law, Prawo komunikacji elektronicznej, in force since 10 November 2024), which you may withdraw at any time without affecting what was lawfully done before."}]
